    [2.8] Fix poc cli 22 sec timeout issue (#4579)
    
    ### Description
    
    Fix `nvflare poc stop` / `job abort` fail when invoked within ~22s of
    `nvflare job submit`
    
    ### Types of changes
    <!--- Put an `x` in all the boxes that apply, and remove the not
    applicable items -->
